Comment.4:
05/Apr/2024 09:04;yy215;Hi,
First we need to ask our spark experts to calculate better the usage of the reserved memory they do with dp_config. We saw though charts in checkmk that the host was not using fully the memory while YARN informs that are not enough resources available. YARN is appropriately tuned to use all the physical resources, so this means that jobs are reserving more memory than they use.

Second we should add more workers to the cluster, from a technical point of view, won't be hard for us to join new hosts to the clusters, just some preparations and in one or two days we could add a couple. The discussion here is more about budget than technical.;;;

